WEBVTT

00:10.688 --> 00:11.695
Roaming the street's...

00:11.896 --> 00:13.071
end and lane's edge,

00:13.096 --> 00:14.434
yet never yielding.

00:14.605 --> 00:15.659
Peddling dope...

00:15.684 --> 00:16.647
and drugs,

00:16.672 --> 00:18.188
yet always
brotherhood shielding.

00:19.813 --> 00:21.337
After the turmoil...

00:23.250 --> 00:24.416
of killings,

00:24.698 --> 00:25.822
bloodbaths,

00:26.648 --> 00:27.822
loss,

00:28.563 --> 00:29.563
and pain.

00:30.890 --> 00:32.636
In order to protect his friends,

00:32.668 --> 00:34.899
Ba gave his life in the battle
at The North Port.

00:36.063 --> 00:39.506
Cuong went to prison
to pay for what he had done.

00:39.531 --> 00:41.455
Using his abilities,

00:41.480 --> 00:44.205
Hao has led Chinatown
to function more expertly each day.

00:44.245 --> 00:46.788
He has created
multiple flourishing front businesses.

00:46.813 --> 00:49.966
Long and Phong have
become his powerful right-hand men.

00:50.193 --> 00:52.413
The security situation
is more unstable than ever.

00:52.438 --> 00:57.075
Hung's leadership in the battle against
crime has intensified at this phase.

00:59.079 --> 00:59.996
That action...

01:00.021 --> 01:03.506
has had a direct impact
on the benefits of a covert group,

01:03.675 --> 01:05.775
forcing them to
free the tiger back into the woods.

01:05.950 --> 01:07.705
They are
considered to be the Council,

01:07.730 --> 01:10.216
a group that
manipulates the underworld's hierarchy.

01:11.880 --> 01:12.746
Chinatown...

01:12.771 --> 01:14.396
is more unstable than ever.

01:27.485 --> 01:31.829
BROTHERS FOR LIFE 3

02:02.230 --> 02:03.563
Mom!

02:21.872 --> 02:22.455
Mom!

02:22.480 --> 02:23.979
Look at me!

02:24.129 --> 02:25.958
Mom!
Mom! Look at me!

02:26.578 --> 02:27.578
Mom!

02:28.146 --> 02:29.146
Ambulance!

02:29.188 --> 02:30.580
Call an ambulance!

02:30.856 --> 02:32.381
Hung!
Call an ambulance!

02:38.436 --> 02:40.000
Mom!

02:41.253 --> 02:42.253
Ambulance!

02:42.448 --> 02:44.271
Mom!

03:06.472 --> 03:08.935
[Episode 4: Blood for blood]

03:19.688 --> 03:21.187
If you keep being like this,

03:21.438 --> 03:22.758
when will you
ever find a husband?

03:25.902 --> 03:26.942
But is it really necessary

03:27.808 --> 03:29.499
for you to handle this matter?

03:30.594 --> 03:33.034
Dad, you still believe
in my people-reading skills, don't you?

03:37.902 --> 03:40.566
If all things
are effortlessly achieved,

03:41.506 --> 03:42.988
how can we distinguish

03:43.438 --> 03:44.854
between the wise

03:44.879 --> 03:46.273
and the ordinary?

03:48.741 --> 03:50.397
The harder the struggle,

03:51.006 --> 03:52.574
the greater the triumph.

03:53.860 --> 03:55.279
He who persists until the end...

03:55.304 --> 03:56.544
is considered the strongest.

03:57.402 --> 03:59.308
That's just a natural law.

03:59.703 --> 04:01.640
But why should you get involved?

04:02.889 --> 04:04.335
He's about to flood Chinatown with drugs,

04:04.359 --> 04:06.175
yet those guys at the top
aren't saying anything?

04:07.956 --> 04:09.312
Unpolished jade...

04:10.412 --> 04:11.793
won't gleam as brightly.

04:12.664 --> 04:13.991
I believe...

04:14.016 --> 04:15.507
your raw jade...

04:15.532 --> 04:16.532
will shine one day.

04:25.694 --> 04:26.748
Doctor!

04:26.773 --> 04:28.128
How is my mom's condition?

04:28.389 --> 04:29.902
We are keeping track closely.

04:30.068 --> 04:31.455
She needs to rest.

04:31.485 --> 04:32.845
Please refrain
from disturbing her.

04:35.385 --> 04:36.619
Thank you, doctor.

04:38.935 --> 04:39.935
Long!

04:39.960 --> 04:40.960
Hung!

04:43.107 --> 04:44.107
What happened?

04:44.370 --> 04:45.370
How is mom?

04:52.683 --> 04:53.683
How is she?

04:56.034 --> 04:57.034
Speak!

04:57.448 --> 04:58.934
Who sent you to do this?

05:03.092 --> 05:03.708
Who?

05:03.867 --> 05:05.665
Your father sent me.

05:19.328 --> 05:20.747
Nice tattoo, huh?

05:21.141 --> 05:22.476
Is this
your identifying feature?

05:24.664 --> 05:26.319
What if I take this to the cops,

05:26.855 --> 05:28.776
to Din, and even to Chinatown,

05:29.820 --> 05:31.294
telling them it's you...

05:31.319 --> 05:33.090
who's been providing me
with information to bust shipments?

05:33.985 --> 05:35.710
How does that
scenario sound to you?

05:36.026 --> 05:37.026
Hah?

05:37.258 --> 05:40.511
You'll be the next target
for both the black and the red sides.

05:40.878 --> 05:43.657
You bitch!

05:44.542 --> 05:45.905
Release me right now,

05:45.930 --> 05:46.930
you worthless mutts!

05:47.487 --> 05:48.487
Are you clear?

05:58.159 --> 05:59.601
I will help you

06:00.672 --> 06:02.089
if you obey my words.

06:08.850 --> 06:10.970
Our job was to pick up
the goods at the rat warehouse.

06:14.977 --> 06:16.581
Then we headed to the garage

06:17.344 --> 06:18.761
to swap the license plate,

06:24.235 --> 06:25.652
then we delivered them to Din.

06:38.139 --> 06:41.019
The money we received
is stored at the rat warehouse.

06:41.128 --> 06:42.534
I don't know his identity.

06:43.412 --> 06:44.695
I've never seen his face.

06:44.951 --> 06:46.865
We're simply
transporters for the goods.

06:52.847 --> 06:53.930
Transporters?

06:54.448 --> 06:56.375
Transporters
doubling as hit men?

06:58.652 --> 07:00.984
The situation with
Long's mother was accidental.

07:01.289 --> 07:02.952
I was only
instructed to handle Long.

07:02.977 --> 07:04.061
Shut your mouth!

07:05.402 --> 07:06.610
I need a name.

07:07.652 --> 07:08.652
Sau Mui.

07:09.492 --> 07:11.503
That's all I know.

07:13.674 --> 07:16.808
Now would you
fucking let me go, you mutts?

07:48.902 --> 07:50.610
Be a bit quicker with your hands.

07:53.672 --> 07:54.672
Hurry up.

07:54.826 --> 07:56.159
It's almost time.

08:07.571 --> 08:08.490
Brother Sau.

08:08.515 --> 08:10.273
In two days
we will have enough goods.

08:14.177 --> 08:15.570
Our area has been taken.

08:16.636 --> 08:17.876
Our brothers have been injured.

08:18.721 --> 08:20.114
He's threatened
right at our doorsteps,

08:20.139 --> 08:21.609
hunted us down to the nape.

08:24.037 --> 08:25.687
Yet you tell me to sit still?

08:26.461 --> 08:28.319
Sit still
and await death, is that it?

08:32.844 --> 08:34.123
Brotherhood...

08:34.414 --> 08:35.653
my ass.

08:37.420 --> 08:40.280
What fucking entitlement
do you hold to forbid me?

08:44.350 --> 08:45.516
Fuck them!

09:13.383 --> 09:15.023
Please don't
make things difficult for me.

09:18.765 --> 09:21.430
Din has nothing to do
with Long's mom's situation.

09:23.592 --> 09:25.300
There's a phantom
lurking behind this issue

09:25.901 --> 09:28.157
that I can't talk about.

09:38.750 --> 09:40.459
If you cannot talk about it,

09:41.844 --> 09:43.799
then I'm going to find them

09:43.847 --> 09:44.847
to see who they are.

09:46.991 --> 09:48.437
Stop being so reckless.

09:49.811 --> 09:50.811
Phong!

10:08.485 --> 10:09.645
Only by becoming stronger...

10:10.561 --> 10:12.233
can you save the weak.

10:13.925 --> 10:15.608
Only by surviving until the end

10:16.700 --> 10:18.493
can you save everybody.

10:28.089 --> 10:29.089
Long!

10:30.039 --> 10:31.562
About Chinatown's situation…

10:33.543 --> 10:34.543
Don't worry.

10:35.972 --> 10:38.373
There are a few
things I need to take care of

10:39.070 --> 10:41.301
before we can move back to
the countryside and live a quiet life.

10:53.561 --> 10:54.644
I'm really worried.

10:55.477 --> 10:56.441
It's okay,

10:56.466 --> 10:57.466
don't worry.

11:16.711 --> 11:17.711
I'm listening.

11:18.446 --> 11:20.174
I found his den.

11:46.701 --> 11:47.951
What are you doing?

11:50.433 --> 11:51.433
Put those things away.

11:51.467 --> 11:52.467
Yes, brother.

11:59.058 --> 12:00.535
Hide them carefully.

12:00.577 --> 12:01.802
Where's the scimitar?

12:53.948 --> 12:56.050
I thought
you'd gather the whole Chinatown gang.

12:56.075 --> 12:56.915
Turns out…

12:56.940 --> 12:57.940
Shut the fuck up.

12:58.401 --> 12:59.921
Give me
the bastard who stabbed my mom.

13:03.615 --> 13:05.816
To keep
your guys from spilling blood,

13:07.328 --> 13:08.928
let's settle this
with a one-on-one duel.

13:10.094 --> 13:11.302
If you win,

13:11.959 --> 13:13.301
the one who stabbed your mom

13:13.866 --> 13:15.222
belongs to you.

13:15.995 --> 13:16.995
If I win,

13:18.826 --> 13:20.529
everything that
is yours shall be mine.

13:21.797 --> 13:22.716
Son of a bitch!

13:22.741 --> 13:24.071
- Duel me!
- Fine!

13:25.735 --> 13:26.855
I will have a duel with you.

13:30.688 --> 13:31.688
Be careful.

14:22.375 --> 14:23.375
Go!

14:35.144 --> 14:36.673
Fuck! Did you use gun?

14:36.870 --> 14:38.270
Take them all
to the police station!

14:55.420 --> 14:56.596
Ta Dinh Phong.

14:57.086 --> 14:58.086
Yes?

14:58.891 --> 15:00.011
My parents named me like that.

15:00.036 --> 15:01.036
Sit here.

15:01.584 --> 15:02.584
Bro!

15:03.102 --> 15:04.617
We're acquaintances.

15:04.880 --> 15:05.752
How about…

15:05.777 --> 15:06.952
I'm not your acquaintance.

15:06.977 --> 15:07.519
Be quiet!

15:07.571 --> 15:08.920
You can leave now.

15:09.058 --> 15:10.058
Thank you, sir.

15:14.000 --> 15:15.000
Next two people, please.

15:15.145 --> 15:15.768
What?

15:15.793 --> 15:16.793
Officer?

15:16.899 --> 15:17.676
The hell?

15:17.888 --> 15:19.270
Why did you send him home?

15:19.295 --> 15:20.616
We didn't do anything.

15:20.641 --> 15:21.115
Shut up!

15:21.140 --> 15:21.885
Listen!

15:21.910 --> 15:23.381
He stabbed my friend violently,

15:23.406 --> 15:25.206
making his intestines
protrude from the wound.

15:25.436 --> 15:27.123
And you let him leave?

15:41.745 --> 15:43.665
Why are we
being detained for 48 hours?

15:43.690 --> 15:44.690
Phong, shut up.

15:49.102 --> 15:50.967
Hung!

15:51.883 --> 15:52.883
Fuck.

15:53.430 --> 15:54.610
He ignored me.

15:55.272 --> 15:56.272
Do you know him?

15:56.982 --> 15:58.774
He's our best friend.

15:59.349 --> 16:00.294
Quiet!

16:00.319 --> 16:02.128
You guys came to
other people's place to cause trouble.

16:02.153 --> 16:04.241
You're lucky
they haven't sued you yet.

16:04.266 --> 16:05.667
Write the report!

16:08.140 --> 16:09.539
Shut your mouth, Phong.

16:09.564 --> 16:10.564
It's Hung's fault!

16:10.589 --> 16:12.524
Brothers my ass.

16:12.549 --> 16:13.007
Shut up.

16:13.032 --> 16:13.836
Quiet!

16:16.620 --> 16:17.674
Unfortunately,

16:17.699 --> 16:19.866
I have to remove
Comrade Hung from the case

16:20.008 --> 16:22.811
due to his errors
and disorganized conduct.

16:23.381 --> 16:25.319
The decision
will take effect immediately.

16:25.850 --> 16:27.490
Do you have
anything to say, comrade Hung?

16:29.206 --> 16:30.206
Yes?

16:37.725 --> 16:38.725
Our area has been taken.

16:39.433 --> 16:40.673
Our brothers have been injured.

16:41.642 --> 16:42.993
He's threatened
right at our doorsteps,

16:43.024 --> 16:44.191
hunted us down to the nape.

16:44.832 --> 16:47.186
Brotherhood my ass.

16:47.350 --> 16:49.795
What fucking entitlement
do you hold to forbid me?

16:57.600 --> 16:58.600
What's the matter?

16:58.767 --> 16:59.847
Are you feeling discontent?

17:02.469 --> 17:05.560
I just can't bear losing
more of the people I consider my family.

17:07.309 --> 17:08.560
I hope you'll understand.

17:09.892 --> 17:10.892
I...

17:12.699 --> 17:14.866
will protect them in my own way.

17:17.225 --> 17:18.225
I have to go now.

17:20.267 --> 17:21.267
Hung.

17:24.525 --> 17:25.525
Wait.

17:32.225 --> 17:33.225
Hello, sir.

17:33.428 --> 17:34.468
I'm Attorney Minh,

17:34.493 --> 17:35.613
representing the law office.

17:35.725 --> 17:37.807
I'm here to
post bail for these two.

17:53.684 --> 17:54.684
Who are you?

17:55.558 --> 17:56.808
Why did you help us?

17:57.629 --> 18:00.351
Some mice are delivering
miscellaneous things to Chinatown.

18:00.663 --> 18:01.418
Do you know that?

18:01.443 --> 18:02.443
We do.

18:02.878 --> 18:06.045
Jeez, there's nothing
that we can't see through.

18:06.184 --> 18:07.225
Don't worry.

18:07.725 --> 18:08.805
We'll have them eliminated.

18:10.517 --> 18:11.797
That's also a way to make money.

18:11.850 --> 18:13.017
It's a bad idea.

18:13.184 --> 18:14.184
You'll be at risk

18:14.559 --> 18:15.725
of ending up behind bars.

18:16.318 --> 18:18.317
Besides, I'm
sharing this with you…

18:18.342 --> 18:19.342
I'm asking Long.

18:27.517 --> 18:28.517
Drugs...

18:30.559 --> 18:32.350
serve only to ruin this society.

18:34.017 --> 18:36.800
Besides, we also
depend on society for our existence.

18:37.725 --> 18:40.214
Big Brother's words
are the rule of Chinatown.

18:41.309 --> 18:43.112
Avoid drugs at all costs.

18:46.258 --> 18:47.862
Those in prison

18:47.982 --> 18:50.682
wouldn't know
how society is progressing.

18:50.938 --> 18:54.370
Do you not see how outdated that
mindset is in comparison to Chinatown now?

18:57.975 --> 18:59.290
If you know Big Brother,

19:00.426 --> 19:02.112
I assume
you heard about me as well.

19:02.137 --> 19:04.001
I guess you
also know me, don't you?

19:04.517 --> 19:06.641
Perhaps Chinatown
has been outdated.

19:07.850 --> 19:09.016
Or maybe

19:09.684 --> 19:11.434
Chinatown
has no longer been clean.

19:14.684 --> 19:16.142
But it will forever be my home,

19:16.642 --> 19:18.100
my family.

19:19.559 --> 19:21.680
And I will do everything...

19:21.767 --> 19:23.162
to protect Chinatown.

19:27.559 --> 19:30.084
That's the way we are.

19:30.109 --> 19:31.109
High five!

19:32.560 --> 19:33.559
High five!

19:35.975 --> 19:36.975
High five!

19:41.142 --> 19:42.988
You haven't answered my question.

19:46.267 --> 19:47.831
I am neither your enemy

19:48.100 --> 19:49.273
nor your friend.

19:50.100 --> 19:51.417
I'm not helping you guys.

19:52.184 --> 19:54.074
I'm just trying to save Chinatown.

19:54.435 --> 19:55.602
Wow.

19:55.934 --> 19:58.019
You're so cool.

20:00.104 --> 20:00.767
Oh,

20:00.927 --> 20:03.825
I have a question
that I want to ask you.

20:03.850 --> 20:05.100
I wonder if you…

20:06.934 --> 20:07.659
Well…

20:07.684 --> 20:08.684
I…

20:09.559 --> 20:10.559
I

20:11.534 --> 20:12.517
Long!

20:14.813 --> 20:15.813
Hey,

20:16.100 --> 20:17.392
- Listen.
- Talk to you later.

20:18.059 --> 20:19.059
Thank you!

20:30.975 --> 20:31.542
Oh.

20:31.822 --> 20:33.328
My house is right ahead.

20:34.392 --> 20:35.788
I go the opposite direction.

20:38.310 --> 20:40.617
You're not
just pretty, you're also edgy.

20:40.642 --> 20:41.642
I like that.

20:46.517 --> 20:48.354
Bye bye, cat eyes.

21:22.188 --> 21:22.860
Long!

21:23.012 --> 21:24.012
Dung!

21:39.682 --> 21:44.393
 BROTHERS FOR LIFE 3
